<title>USA: Evesham, N.J., agency deal yields 5.50 pct in 2012.</title>
<headline>Evesham, N.J., agency deal yields 5.50 pct in 2012.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat First Butcher Singer said Wednesday it tentatively priced $5 million Evesham Municipal Utilities Authority, N.J., bonds to yield 5.50 percent in 2012.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
