<p>BANK QUALIFIED</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>MBIA INSURED</p>
<p>    DATED: 10/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 01/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 07/01</p>
